Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.93,0:00:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are real life dragon slayers? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are evil beasts out there that do\Nbad things to people called devil dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.21,0:00:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one mighty and\Nbrave adventurer slayed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of those dragons by\Ncutting off his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the scales, claws, fangs,\Nand bones of the creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were used to create high\Nquality weapons and medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.11,0:00:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It brought great wealth\Nto the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, the brave and\Nmighty adventurer was a hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who the people called the Dragon Slayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.19,0:00:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be one!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be a Dragon Slayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.71,0:00:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no easy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.57,0:00:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some dragons are incredibly tough and fierce,\Nand have lived for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can make the ground\Ntremble just by walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even crumble mountains\Nwith a swat of their tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, long ago this continent was almost\Ndestroyed by the dragons running wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:01:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd chomp on little kids\Nlike you for a snack, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.29,0:01:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.21,0:01:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over there huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.12,0:01:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it trouble I don't know but I\Nhave this crazy feeling something's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.33,0:01:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out there ahead of us, I don't see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.17,0:01:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything you don't it's right there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.07,0:01:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can this be a dragon of calamity?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.87,0:01:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.57,0:01:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.97,0:01:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to take
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.17,0:02:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Off my feelings. I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.65,0:02:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what I can achieve. I\Nwant to find what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to touch
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.79,0:02:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go back to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.29,0:02:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see the number I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.29,0:02:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see the\Nlight that has a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not too old.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.89,0:03:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does the Empire not understand\Nthe terror they have unleashed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our records state that it's only been 150
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.97,0:03:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,years since the beast\Nfell into hibernation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.59,0:03:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be in its dormant\Nperiod right now. The fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.35,0:03:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who resorts to using something so\Ndevastating over a simple dispute?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickly now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,round up everyone who took shelter in the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:03:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,capital and have them\Nevacuate immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.67,0:04:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone yes sir, if they try to stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,carry them out, if they cling\Nto their belongings, drag them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.69,0:04:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave not a single person in the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.47,0:04:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sensing that obstruction\Nmagic is being used.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's blocking the exits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be impossible now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.15,0:04:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sovereign Six won't be able to unite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.91,0:04:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn these wretched nuisances!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When that thing gets here,\Nwe won't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.59,0:04:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you warriors to protect the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.25,0:04:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Focus on guiding them\Naway from the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.55,0:05:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and take refuge wherever you can find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.23,0:05:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have my own responsibilities\Nright here in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.91,0:05:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the path of that dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there is no doubt the capital\Nwill be thoroughly destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, they should\Nbe evacuating everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If so, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my father, he'll surely choose to stay\Nbehind and use himself as a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.49,0:05:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even someone as strong as him is\Nno match for something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.13,0:05:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.09,0:05:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.71,0:05:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dragon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, they're even bigger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.55,0:05:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the first one\NI've ever seen in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.13,0:05:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just defeated a Black Death dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.89,0:05:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lin, do you happen to know if your\Nbrother and father are still in the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt they've stayed behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's too late for us to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.69,0:06:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I think I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you run?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.93,0:06:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look how far away we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.73,0:06:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what we did against the goblin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.47,0:06:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we could do that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.65,0:06:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the wind blast we used?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.47,0:06:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I suppose that would be one option.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.49,0:06:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's going to hit you pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sword will take the brunt of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.49,0:06:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe a lot to your dad\Nand the people of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I want to lend them a hand if I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.95,0:06:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting him out shouldn't be too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely I can handle that much at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.29,0:06:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.09,0:06:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I sitting here being pessimistic?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.99,0:06:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he says he can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Windblast is not normally\Na spell that's used on people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.49,0:07:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is one person who I should\Nnot try to compare with anybody normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.11,0:07:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.99,0:07:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you're telling me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foolish of you, King Clays.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crushing your meager country into\Nsubmission is a simple task for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter the extent of your threats,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot and will not hand the\NDungeon of the Lost over to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your idle hands are letting\Nsuch great power go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.05,0:07:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Combined with the\Nintelligence of my empire,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.55,0:07:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it could be a military force strong\Nenough to control the known world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We merely chose not to use a power\Nthat's beyond what we can control.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.73,0:07:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you can understand the\Nrepercussions of such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that is precisely why you will\Nforever be a king of insignificance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.53,0:08:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I've known you, you have\Nnever had the starch in you to rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.77,0:08:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else that he cares about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only wants to get his hands\Non what's in that dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.11,0:08:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I underestimated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never expected he would throw the\Nfull force of his might like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Letting negotiations break\Ndown was a mistake on my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.67,0:08:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good father!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The capital faces certain doom, and\Nall I can think about is my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:09:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some leader I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.17,0:09:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never had it in me to be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.83,0:09:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always been more\Nsuited for the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry to the people of this fine
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,country who have blindly\Nobeyed their foolish king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.09,0:09:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be enough to make amends\Nfor my sins, but at the very least,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.95,0:09:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take one of\Nits damn eyes with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.85,0:09:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Summon Divine Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.31,0:09:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor, stand in front of this cylinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic Barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.29,0:09:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reflect!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.93,0:09:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic Reflect!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.97,0:09:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enhance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.83,0:09:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.75,0:09:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems different from\Nthe last time we did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.69,0:10:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Condense!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.99,0:10:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.91,0:10:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be much more intense than last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologies in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.75,0:10:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.93,0:10:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Multicast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.39,0:10:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I've put everything\Nthat I have into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.85,0:10:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six-ball cast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.77,0:10:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Windblast Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.53,0:10:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kei-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Godspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the same Elder\NDragon who just several
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.75,0:10:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hundred years ago burned down the realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not going to give me\Nthe chance to retaliate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I must do something kingly at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A grand finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.27,0:11:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.39,0:11:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to show you how resolute we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Blasting Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.11,0:11:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It channels all the wielder's\Nsacrificial mana into one final blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.71,0:11:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's sacrificing himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.11,0:12:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Covered in a cloud of dust\Nbecause of this little
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.93,0:12:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,person the strong control\Nthe weak and crush
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.91,0:12:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them with violence that\Nis the natural law of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.47,0:12:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this world and any who\Ndare oppose it shall fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.65,0:12:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's what I'm going to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's what I'm going to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.17,0:13:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.65,0:13:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was just about to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six-Bull Cast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.61,0:13:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wind Blast Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physical enhancement!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.09,0:13:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, the walls!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.35,0:14:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so far away just a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna smash into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.85,0:14:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.77,0:14:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I made it in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.85,0:14:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm gonna tell Lin we're\Nnever doing that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.89,0:14:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyways, that was easier\Nto parry than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.13,0:14:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shock how huge\Nthis dragon actually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.81,0:14:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The impact from Lin's magic\Nreally threw me for a loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So really, this doesn't\Nseem all that scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, I think I might\Nbe able to fight this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.53,0:15:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe all the damage. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.09,0:15:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.23,0:15:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the two of us will find the\Nking and get him out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.05,0:15:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while Sir Noor fights the Elder Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.05,0:15:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, above you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.67,0:15:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.91,0:15:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.31,0:15:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh, I need\Nyou to stay close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goblin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.85,0:15:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emperors!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.01,0:15:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Comparatively, they're quite small\Nto the one Noor and I confronted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're still Goblin Emperors, and\Nthey are monsters in a league of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How should we fight them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to start thinking\Nlike Instructor Noor does.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.07,0:15:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.63,0:16:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.35,0:16:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our fight is with some mere Goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.05,0:16:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.63,0:16:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compared to that dragon, this is\Nsomething we can easily handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.11,0:16:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep our cool and take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.67,0:16:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, ice dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.05,0:16:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They still stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stopped moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.21,0:16:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How he does!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a nest for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only do people call\Nher the Divine Shield,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she's more than worthy of\Nher Divine Sword, Title II.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while Rolo...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.27,0:17:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw him stop those huge\Ngoblins with just a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon folk are a marvel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.65,0:17:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much power within such a young boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.45,0:17:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must take a great deal of courage\Nto wield something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.85,0:17:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.73,0:17:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.03,0:17:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.03,0:17:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My claws and scales are indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.61,0:18:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear this thing never gets a single\Nscratch, no matter what hits it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what is the\Ndeal with this sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.31,0:18:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, it is the key to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.41,0:18:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use my attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.89,0:18:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That has never failed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.15,0:18:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.85,0:19:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just parried the dragon's breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.91,0:19:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.63,0:19:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's angry. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.01,0:19:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.87,0:19:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dragon's frustrated because Noor\Nisn't treating it as a serious threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.27,0:19:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not used to being so disregarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.95,0:19:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragons are very prideful beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially the Elder Dragon, which\Nbelieves it is more powerful than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.09,0:19:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in watching this fight,\Nit's almost as though...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.45,0:19:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who is weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.53,0:19:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who is small.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.03,0:20:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.73,0:20:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.71,0:20:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like it's calmed\Ndown. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.17,0:20:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's actually submitting to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.65,0:20:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.95,0:20:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.91,0:21:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the scales, claws,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fangs, and bones of the creature,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they were used to create\Nhigh-quality weapons and medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It brought great wealth\Nto the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.09,0:21:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.01,0:21:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the brave and mighty adventurer was a hero\NWho the people called the Dragon Slayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.01,0:21:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.99,0:21:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm exactly hero material.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.85,0:21:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't want to fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.13,0:21:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor! Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.76,0:22:09.72,Freehand 471 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs37}#8 I Parry a Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.33,0:22:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.73,0:22:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.13,0:22:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.47,0:22:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.39,0:22:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.07,0:22:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.99,0:22:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to die on this side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.05,0:22:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.03,0:22:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you give up your heart,\Nit's not the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.41,0:22:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let you go. Don't let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.69,0:23:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let you go. Don't let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.85,0:23:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let you go. Don't let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.49,0:23:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a shot, clap, clap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.47,0:23:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.27,0:23:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.63,0:23:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.

